# ============================================================
#  Reporting — Scheduled Reports
# ============================================================

# ---- WALKTHROUGH REPORT ------------------------------------
# Title       : Daily SSH Server - Outbound coms
# Description : A daily report showing the top 3 destinations sourcing from
#               our SSH server (178.128.237.149). Review the destination IP -
#               is the expected process being followed?
# Schedule    : Run every day at 0:00 | Time Range: Yesterday
index="mydfir-lab1" src_ip=178.128.237.149
| top limit=3 dest_ip
# -> 178.128.225.222 (62.7%), 43.135.172.223 (5.65%), 104.248.150.105 (5.65%)

# ---- SCENARIO REPORT ---------------------------------------
# Prompt      : Daily report of successful administrative logins from the day
#               before. Filter out SYSTEM and machine accounts. Include time,
#               user and computer, sorted earliest-first.
# Title       : Daily Windows- Successfull administrative logins
# Description : Daily report that reviews the successful administrative logins
#               that occurred the day before.
# Schedule    : Run every day at 2:00 | Time Range: Yesterday
index="mydfir-lab1" host="winvm" EventCode=4672 user!=*$ user!=SYSTEM
| stats count by _time user ComputerName
| sort +_time
